codex
Classification did not already have protection: its shared SupCon helper and both client/edge callers run under fp16 autocast just like segmentation. I’m putting the fp32 boundary inside each shared loss helper, which protects every current client/edge call without moving the expensive model forward out of autocast, then adding the segmentation client-prototype warning.
